WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.000
♪ radio playing softly ♪

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.000
THEO: Gran loves me.
I'm her favourite grandson.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.400
MAYA: You're her only grandson.
Low bar.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:04.600
THEO: A bar is a bar.
I cleared it &amp; I'm proud.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.900
MAYA: Okay, hotshot. Let's see
if the croissants rise to the occasion.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.200
[timer dings]

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:16.500
THEO: Look at that. Golden.
I'm basically a genius.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.600
MAYA: Don't count your croissants
before they're plated.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:24.800
THEO: Is that an actual saying,
or did you just make it up?

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:28.700
MAYA: I'm a baker. I knead
to have my own sayings.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.600
THEO: Wow. That pun was
half-baked at best.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.900
MAYA: And yet here you are,
eating it up.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:40.800
THEO: Fair enough. Noon, then.
We've got this.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:44.600
MAYA: We'd better. Gran's watching
from upstairs, you know.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:48.000
- She's always watching.
- Always.
